1
00:00:01,080 --> 00:00:04,168
爸爸们会很想你俩的 玩得开心哦
Daddies will miss you both so much! Have the best time!

2
00:00:04,168 --> 00:00:05,052
再见 亲爱的
Bye, honey.

3
00:00:05,220 --> 00:00:08,440
* 家里只有我俩了 只有我俩了 *
* We're alone! We're alone! We're alone! We're alone! *

4
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:11,020
外面有个盒子 上面写着每月水果
There's a box out here marked fruit of the month.

5
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:13,680
我想是因为你们赢了比赛才有 不是买的吧
I'm assuming that means one of you won a contest.

6
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:15,920
小帕在我们家楼上
So, Pam's moving back home

7
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:18,660
住了大概三年后 终于要搬回家了
after living in our upstairs unit for like three years.

8
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:20,900
行了 就一年零九天
Uh, okay, it's been a year and nine days,

9
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:22,400
她帮我们砍了那木头呢
and she chopped us all that wood.

10
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:24,460
而且她带莉莉回去见我父母
Plus, she's taking Lily back to see my parents.

11
00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:27,420
现在是生育季 莉莉可以头一回给猪取名了
It's birthing season so she gets to name her first pig.

12
00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:29,820
然后她13岁生日时我们就杀了那猪
Oh, and then we slaughter it on her 13th birthday.

13
00:00:29,820 --> 00:00:30,920
有祈祷 也有跳舞
There's prayers and dancing.

14
00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:32,460
跟标准的犹太成年礼大同小异啦
It's not unlike your standard bar mitzvah.

15
00:00:32,580 --> 00:00:34,640
不过多了很多猪肉 少了很多犹太人
Except a lot more pork and a lot less Jews.

16
00:00:35,140 --> 00:00:38,040
总之 我们很高兴又能在家单独相处了
Anyway, we're excited to have the house to ourselves again.

17
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:41,600
* 裸体早餐 裸体早餐 *
* Naked breakfast, naked breakfast *

18
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:43,360
别管了
Just ignore it.

19
00:00:43,427 --> 00:00:46,773
* 做着香肠和粗燕麦粉 衣不遮体 *
* Making sausages and grits, barely coverin' our bits *

20
00:00:46,773 --> 00:00:50,616
* 煎着意大利烘蛋饼 一丝不挂 *
* Cookin' a frittata while wearin' nada *

21
00:00:52,020 --> 00:00:55,520
我就知道你俩不会锁侧门
I knew you two would keep the side door unlocked.

22
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:59,040
如果我是变态神经病 你们会怎么做
What would you do if I were a deranged psychopath?

23
00:00:59,040 --> 00:01:01,700
我也许会先说 "妈妈 你来这干什么"
I'd probably start with, "Hi, Mom, what are you doing here?"

24
00:01:01,860 --> 00:01:03,900
杰瑞和我大吵一架
Jerry and I had a terrible row!

25
00:01:04,364 --> 00:01:06,792
穿条裤子吧 我们好拥抱
Well, put on some pants so we can hug.

26
00:01:06,792 --> 00:01:08,885
-好吧 -背靠背
- Okay. Yeah, yeah, yeah. - Back to back.

27
00:01:09,953 --> 00:01:11,000
我们为什么不倒退着出去
Why didn't we just back out?

28
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:12,460
我不知道 但已经开始这样就得坚持到底
I don't know, but we're already committed to this.

29
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:28,100
好 最后一次试飞 然后我们就开始收拾
Okay, last run, and then we clean up

30
00:01:28,100 --> 00:01:29,980
不然你妈妈会生气的 等等 成功了
or your mom will be mad. hang on, here we go.

31
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:31,540
去吧
And go!

32
00:01:35,600 --> 00:01:36,550
做得好
Nice job.

33
00:01:37,120 --> 00:01:37,860
保持稳定
Keep her steady.

34
00:01:38,520 --> 00:01:40,340
-好 -你可以的
- Okay. - Got this.

35
00:01:41,900 --> 00:01:42,240
不
No!

36
00:01:42,340 --> 00:01:43,080
不好
Oh, no.

37
00:01:43,360 --> 00:01:44,480
不好
Oh, no!

38
00:01:45,940 --> 00:01:47,398
我最近坐着
I recently sat for

39
00:01:47,398 --> 00:01:50,020
让人画了普里契特橱柜董事长肖像
my Pritchett's Closets presidential portrait.

40
00:01:50,020 --> 00:01:51,640
这是我爸开始的愚蠢传统
It's a dumb tradition my dad started,

41
00:01:51,640 --> 00:01:54,080
但我挺喜欢我的画像的
but I kind of love the way mine turned out.

42
00:01:54,080 --> 00:01:56,220
至少这比他的画像更低调
At least it's more understated than his.

43
00:01:56,220 --> 00:01:57,860
色彩柔和
The colors are muted

44
00:01:57,860 --> 00:02:01,060
我也没穿饰带和佩枪
and I am not wearing a sash and service revolver.

45
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:02,440
我们死定了
We're dead.

46
00:02:02,660 --> 00:02:04,440
我们不该玩...
We never should have played with --

47
00:02:04,440 --> 00:02:06,320
无人机呢 你把它关了吗
Where is the drone? Did you turn it off?

48
00:02:06,500 --> 00:02:08,020
人家在睡觉好吗
I was asleep.

49
00:02:09,540 --> 00:02:12,140
这地方看起来很棒啊
Wow, this place looks dynamite.

50
00:02:12,340 --> 00:02:15,700
我想为曼迪准备一个很棒的电影首映式
I wanted to give Manny a nice premiere for his movie.

51
00:02:15,740 --> 00:02:17,940
他最近创意进入了瓶颈期
He's been in such a dry spell creatively.

52
00:02:18,240 --> 00:02:20,902
那次现代舞表演...
That modern dance recital was like...

53
00:02:20,902 --> 00:02:22,620
我都没眼看那件紧身衣[大便]
Ugh, I couldn't even look at that leotard.

54
00:02:22,620 --> 00:02:24,120
是啦 他是个糟糕的舞者
Okay, yeah, he's a terrible dancer,

55
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:25,340
但你没必要说那个词吧
but you don't have to use that word.

56
00:02:25,340 --> 00:02:27,600
为了交电影课作业 我创作并导演了一部短片
For my film class, I wrote and directed a short.

57
00:02:28,080 --> 00:02:30,340
我认为恐怖片类型最好地阐述了
I felt the horror genre was the best way to grapple with

58
00:02:30,340 --> 00:02:31,360
我们这一时代的艰难挣扎
the struggles of our time.

59
00:02:31,500 --> 00:02:33,460
曼尼一开始带着这项目来找我时
When Manny first came to me with the project...

60
00:02:33,460 --> 00:02:35,980
你读了我放在家里的剧本 然后就强势参与了
You read a script I left out and you elbowed your way in.

61
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:38,080
意思差不多 我本打算当个静默投资人
Semantics. I was gonna be the silent money.

62
00:02:38,100 --> 00:02:40,980
但原来我天生有叙事天赋
But it turns out I've got some natural storytelling talent,

63
00:02:41,040 --> 00:02:42,940
所以我执掌了更偏创作方面的职位
so I took on a more creative role.

64
00:02:43,260 --> 00:02:45,200
即使如此 我也拿到了我的第一个A
In spite of that, I got my first "A."

65
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:47,520
我们的第一个A
Our first "A."

66
00:02:48,200 --> 00:02:50,498
我现在没法处理我妈妈的婚姻闹剧
I can't deal with my mother's marriage drama right now.

67
00:02:50,498 --> 00:02:53,340
没谁能比我们能更快劝好失恋的人
Nobody gets the love-lorn back on their feet

68
00:02:53,340 --> 00:02:55,040
恢复心情 离开咱家
and out the door faster than we do.

69
00:02:55,040 --> 00:02:58,140
我们就展示我们可靠的"心碎工具箱"
We'll just trot out our -- our trusty "Heartbreak kit."

70
00:02:58,140 --> 00:03:00,059
是在柜子里的地震工具箱旁边吗
Is that in the closet next to the earthquake kit?

71
00:03:00,059 --> 00:03:01,220
还有艾萨·凯特[音似工具箱]
And the Eartha Kitt.

72
00:03:01,220 --> 00:03:03,780
你把那些东西放在一起是为了让我高兴吗
Did you put those all in the same place just to delight me?

73
00:03:03,820 --> 00:03:04,360
是的
I did.

74
00:03:05,562 --> 00:03:08,404
有红酒 一本自助书
So, you have wine, a self-help book,

75
00:03:08,404 --> 00:03:11,444
形状是柏拉图式男性身体的抱枕
a-a pillow shaped like the platonic ideal

76
00:03:11,444 --> 00:03:15,260
可供你拥抱或和撒气
of a male torso for cuddling and/or punching...

77
00:03:15,260 --> 00:03:17,440
还有我们给你录的DVD
And a DVD we made for you called

78
00:03:17,440 --> 00:03:19,860
叫"唐娜·莎曼[夏季]奥运会"
the "Donna Summer Olympics."

79
00:03:20,020 --> 00:03:22,440
是最性感男运动员
It's a compilation of all the sexiest male athletes

80
00:03:22,440 --> 00:03:24,440
和迪斯科女王的合集
accompanied by the high queen of disco.

81
00:03:24,440 --> 00:03:26,020
你们这些小伙子啊
Oh, you boys.

82
00:03:26,120 --> 00:03:28,860
真会迎合女人的需求
So sensitive to a woman's needs.

83
00:03:29,780 --> 00:03:30,760
不像是杰瑞
Unlike Jerry.

84
00:03:31,400 --> 00:03:34,680
我跟你们说了他妈妈跟我们住一起吗
Did I tell you that his mother is living with us?

85
00:03:34,980 --> 00:03:36,320
没经过讨论
Yeah, no discussion.

86
00:03:36,660 --> 00:03:38,760
她就带着鸟出现了
She just shows up with her birds.

87
00:03:39,040 --> 00:03:41,480
妈妈 感情是需要牺牲的
Well, you know, Mom, relationships take sacrifice.

88
00:03:41,620 --> 00:03:43,659
小卡的姐姐小帕搬来时
I mean, when Cam's sister Pam moved in,

89
00:03:43,659 --> 00:03:44,769
我也很难接受
it w-- it was hard on me.

90
00:03:44,769 --> 00:03:46,580
我一直都担心
I-I was constantly worried about

91
00:03:46,580 --> 00:03:48,840
损失掉的楼上房间租金
the lost money on the upstairs rental and...

92
00:03:49,620 --> 00:03:52,240
米奇尔 也许我们不该讨论钱
You know, Mitchell, maybe we shouldn't discuss money.

93
00:03:52,260 --> 00:03:53,720
有些不得体
It can be a bit unseemly.

94
00:03:53,720 --> 00:03:55,800
我没打算表现得不得体
I wasn't planning on being unseemly,

95
00:03:56,080 --> 00:03:58,160
这个词我之前从未听你用过
a word I've never heard you use before.

96
00:03:58,160 --> 00:04:00,553
我只是在说
I-I'm simply saying how stressful

97
00:04:00,553 --> 00:04:03,405
有个长期的留宿客人压力有多大
having a long-term house guest can be and...

98
00:04:03,405 --> 00:04:06,888
亲爱的 深呼吸
Oh. Oh, sweetie, yeah, take a breath.

99
00:04:06,888 --> 00:04:09,953
天啊 天啊 不 不
Oh, my -- Oh, my -- Oh, my God. No. No.

100
00:04:09,984 --> 00:04:11,440
我小时候你就这样做
You used to do this when I was young.

101
00:04:11,440 --> 00:04:13,678
这动作你是从我妈妈那儿学到的吗
Did you get this move from my mother?

102
00:04:13,678 --> 00:04:18,820
米奇尔 没必要这样不... 脾气这么大
Mitchell, there is no reason for this uns-- um, high-temper --

103
00:04:18,820 --> 00:04:20,160
不得体 你打算说"不得体"
Unseemly! You were gonna say "Unseemly"!

104
00:04:20,260 --> 00:04:22,079
不得体 你是从她那学到的这个词
Unseemly! You stole that word from her.

105
00:04:22,079 --> 00:04:23,820
好吧 怎么回事
Okay, okay, okay. W-What's going on here?

106
00:04:23,820 --> 00:04:25,640
你俩是 朋友吗
Are you two, um... friends?

107
00:04:25,940 --> 00:04:26,340
是的
Yes.

108
00:04:26,579 --> 00:04:29,931
我们聊电话 发邮件 交换食谱
We talk on the phone, e-mail, exchange recipes.

109
00:04:29,931 --> 00:04:32,417
是因为她我们才经常吃藜麦吗
Oh. Oh, is she the reason we've been eating so much quinoa?

110
00:04:32,417 --> 00:04:34,140
-那是超级食物 -那是超级食物
- It's a super-food. - It's a super-food.

111
00:04:34,140 --> 00:04:36,460
够了 我能和你聊聊吗
Okay, okay. Can I talk to you for a second?

112
00:04:37,580 --> 00:04:38,380
来
Come on.

113
00:04:38,820 --> 00:04:41,540
好 没必要撒谎 因为我已经知道了
Okay, no reason to lie about it, 'cause I already know.

114
00:04:41,620 --> 00:04:43,260
你跟这女人联系多久了
How long have you been involved with this woman?

115
00:04:43,340 --> 00:04:45,580
我能问个问题吗 是不是有可能
Can I ask a question? Is there a chance you're just

116
00:04:45,580 --> 00:04:47,600
你在把事情焦点全带到自己身上了
kind of making this all about Mitchell?

117
00:04:48,180 --> 00:04:48,800
是她
That's her.

118
00:04:49,080 --> 00:04:50,940
你的嘴在动 但这都是她的语言
Your mouth is moving, but that is her talking.

119
00:04:50,940 --> 00:04:52,120
你没看出发生了什么吗
Okay, don't you see what's happening?

120
00:04:52,440 --> 00:04:54,440
她在操控你来控制我
She's manipulating you to manipulate me.

121
00:04:54,680 --> 00:04:56,220
难道你不觉得我够聪明 能看出来
Don't you think I'm smart enough to know

122
00:04:56,220 --> 00:04:58,100
我是否被利用了吗
if I'm being used?

123
00:04:58,180 --> 00:04:59,619
我也有个妈妈
I also have a mom.

124
00:04:59,619 --> 00:05:01,280
你太高估自己了 土包子
You're out of your league here, bumpkin!

125
00:05:01,280 --> 00:05:02,460
这可是城里的妈妈
Okay, this is a city mother!

126
00:05:03,080 --> 00:05:06,180
跟我结婚的那个得体男人上哪儿去了
Wow. What happened to the seemly man I married?

127
00:05:06,940 --> 00:05:08,320
这词不能这样用
You can't use it like that.

128
00:05:09,300 --> 00:05:10,400
看起来怎么样
Okay, how's it looking?

129
00:05:11,300 --> 00:05:12,058
还行
Not bad.

130
00:05:12,058 --> 00:05:13,615
谁会想到妈妈和泰迪·罗斯福[前总统]
Who would've thought Mom and Teddy Roosevelt

131
00:05:13,615 --> 00:05:15,360
门牙都长得一样呢
were identical front-teeth twins?

132
00:05:15,360 --> 00:05:17,520
好吧 给我点时间让我把胶水吹干
Okay, just give me a quick minute to dry the glue.

133
00:05:18,140 --> 00:05:20,520
你能把衣架上那件衬衫丢给我吗
Oh, can you throw that shirt on a hanger for me, actually?

134
00:05:20,540 --> 00:05:22,220
今晚是曼尼的首映式 我得穿得帅一点
I need to look sharp for Manny's premiere tonight.

135
00:05:22,540 --> 00:05:24,240
我扮演警长 这很讽刺
I play the Sheriff, which is ironic

136
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:26,019
因为我在的每一幕焦点全被我"抢"了
because I steal every scene I'm in.

137
00:05:26,019 --> 00:05:27,158
爸爸 不好 胶水融化了
Dad, no! It's melting!

138
00:05:27,158 --> 00:05:28,937
变大胡子了
ZZ Top!

139
00:05:29,100 --> 00:05:30,280
我毁了你妈妈
I've ruined your mother.

140
00:05:31,860 --> 00:05:32,700
等等
Wait a second.

141
00:05:32,860 --> 00:05:34,360
今天是你妈妈的每月水疗日
Today's your mom's monthly spa day.

142
00:05:34,580 --> 00:05:35,436
我没懂
I'm not following.

143
00:05:35,436 --> 00:05:37,260
水疗后会有一小段时间
Afterwards, th-there's a brief window

144
00:05:37,260 --> 00:05:38,760
她处于最放松最善解人意的状态
when she's at her most relaxed and understanding.

145
00:05:38,860 --> 00:05:40,200
那时候最适合跟她说糟糕的消息了
It's the best time to give her bad news.

146
00:05:40,200 --> 00:05:42,140
我本来打算告诉她
I was gonna tell her about the $500

147
00:05:42,140 --> 00:05:44,220
我给打来电话求助的英国人汇了五百块
I wired to that stranded British guy on the phone,

148
00:05:44,240 --> 00:05:45,940
但这似乎更重大
but this seems more important.

149
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:49,040
妈妈在家吗
Hi. Is Mom home?

150
00:05:49,040 --> 00:05:51,920
亲爱的 你打扮得真美 为什么
Honey, you look nice. Why?

151
00:05:52,240 --> 00:05:52,940
是有人在说妈妈吗
Did I hear Mom?

152
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:54,660
等等 你打扮得像个女孩
Wait, you're dressed like a girl.

153
00:05:54,940 --> 00:05:56,340
不 这次的机会之窗是我的
No! You are not using the window.

154
00:05:56,440 --> 00:05:57,420
上次可是你用掉的
You got the last one!

155
00:05:57,460 --> 00:05:58,840
大家都知道妈妈的这个机会之窗吗
Did everyone know about this window?

156
00:05:59,095 --> 00:06:01,178
你们也需要吗 为什么
You guys need it too? For what?

157
00:06:03,460 --> 00:06:06,320
要做出这么蠢的事可不容易
Oh, wow. It is not easy doing something that dumb.

158
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:08,340
所以男人肯定完蛋了
Yeah, this is why men are over.

159
00:06:08,352 --> 00:06:11,120
希望你们享受最后一万年
I hope you enjoyed the last 10,000 years.

160
00:06:11,120 --> 00:06:13,220
听着 我得推掉母亲节跟妈妈的旅行
Listen, I have to bail on our trip with Mom for Mother's Day.

161
00:06:13,420 --> 00:06:15,260
不行 我得推掉 你得去
No! I have to bail, you have to go!

162
00:06:15,280 --> 00:06:16,448
我们邀请她时她都哭了
She cried when we asked her.

163
00:06:16,448 --> 00:06:19,100
我老板说带我去大都会艺术博物馆慈善晚宴
But my boss invited me to the Met Ball.

164
00:06:19,100 --> 00:06:21,880
她的治疗犬得了流感 所以我可以坐头等舱了
Her therapy dog got the flu, so I get to fly first class.

165
00:06:22,760 --> 00:06:23,440
坐在她大腿上
Well, on her lap.

166
00:06:23,560 --> 00:06:25,260
但是比尔想带我去玩
But Bill wants to take me away.

167
00:06:25,500 --> 00:06:26,740
这是我第一回有男友
This is the first time I've had a boyfriend

168
00:06:26,740 --> 00:06:29,060
不会要看着《为黛西小姐开车》度过母亲节
who's not spending Mother's Day watching "Driving Miss Daisy"

169
00:06:29,060 --> 00:06:30,620
并从梳子上拔掉白头发
and pulling gray hairs out of a hairbrush.

170
00:06:30,880 --> 00:06:33,120
一个机会之窗有三个请求 真是破天荒
Three asks in one window, it's unprecedented.

171
00:06:33,490 --> 00:06:35,720
如果我们要成功 那我们要把家里
If we're gonna pull this off, we're gonna have to make this

172
00:06:35,720 --> 00:06:38,220
布置成她去过的最轻松的环境
the most relaxing environment she's ever walked into.

173
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:39,771
惊喜哦
Surprise!

174
00:06:39,771 --> 00:06:41,880
-外婆 -迪迪
- Nana! - Dede!

175
00:06:41,880 --> 00:06:43,287
抱歉我不请自来
I'm sorry to barge in.

176
00:06:43,287 --> 00:06:44,680
我之前去拜访了小卡和米奇
I was visiting Cam and Mitch,

177
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:47,900
他俩之间有些紧张
and there's some tension over there.

178
00:06:48,300 --> 00:06:49,680
我女儿呢
Well, where's my daughter?

179
00:06:49,940 --> 00:06:53,140
我没听到烹饪或者打扫的声音
I don't hear any cooking or cleaning sounds

180
00:06:53,140 --> 00:06:55,020
所以我猜她在家
so I assume she's home.

181
00:06:56,880 --> 00:06:57,896
爸爸 我们要做什么
Dad, what do we do?

182
00:06:57,896 --> 00:07:00,335
肯定是米奇尔送她来的 也许他还在外面
Mitchell must've brought her. Maybe he's still out --

183
00:07:01,720 --> 00:07:02,260
懦夫
Coward!

184
00:07:05,160 --> 00:07:06,740
刚好赶上
Oh, just in time.

185
00:07:07,140 --> 00:07:08,920
第五章 扔掉那小丑
"Chapter Five -- Toss that clown,

186
00:07:09,060 --> 00:07:10,100
他在拖你后腿
he's been keeping you down."

187
00:07:10,360 --> 00:07:11,940
小卡 我这辈子
Cam, I spent my whole life

188
00:07:11,940 --> 00:07:14,299
都想从我妈的五指山下逃出来
trying to get out from underneath my mother's thumb,

189
00:07:14,299 --> 00:07:16,740
我以为我终于摆脱了她
and I-I finally thought that that was over.

190
00:07:16,740 --> 00:07:18,440
所以当我发现她一直
So to find out that she's been

191
00:07:18,440 --> 00:07:20,060
秘密地通过你来控制我
secretly managing me through you --

192
00:07:20,060 --> 00:07:21,980
在你气吐血之前
Okay, before you throw a clot,

193
00:07:22,160 --> 00:07:24,299
拜托你来看看我的笔电
please, come look at my laptop.

194
00:07:24,299 --> 00:07:26,627
读一读你妈和我互发的电邮
Read the e-mails your mother and I have sent.

195
00:07:26,918 --> 00:07:28,820
743封电邮
743 e-mails!

196
00:07:28,820 --> 00:07:29,880
大部分都是同一封电邮的来回
It's mostly from one thread.

197
00:07:30,380 --> 00:07:32,180
好吧 瞧她在这封里说了什么
Okay, look what she says in this one.

198
00:07:32,860 --> 00:07:35,380
"一些你或许会喜欢的厨房用品"
"Some kitchen items you might like."

199
00:07:36,140 --> 00:07:39,440
-炉灶 瓷砖 -什么
- The stove, the tiles... - What?

200
00:07:40,283 --> 00:07:42,760
墙上的乡村风挂牌 小卡
...the-the-the folksy sign on the wall, Cam!

201
00:07:42,760 --> 00:07:44,320
你说这些都是你的主意
You said that these were your ideas.

202
00:07:44,646 --> 00:07:45,992
你没看出她潜移默化地
D-don't you see she incepted you

203
00:07:45,992 --> 00:07:48,380
利用你设计了整个厨房吗
and-and designed our whole kitchen?!

204
00:07:48,380 --> 00:07:51,420
简直不是人 而且越挖越深
It was all so diabolical, and it went deep.

205
00:07:51,620 --> 00:07:54,000
她用计控制我们做了人生中的所有决定
She tricked us into making every decision in our lives.

206
00:07:54,060 --> 00:07:55,500
例如 十二年前
For example, 12 years ago,

207
00:07:55,800 --> 00:07:58,240
她给我发了可爱的亚洲宝宝的图片
she sent me pictures of adorable Asian babies.

208
00:07:58,260 --> 00:08:00,420
同时再利用了我的逆反心理
While hitting me with a little reverse psychology.

209
00:08:01,260 --> 00:08:04,260
"米奇尔 美国已经夺走了越南人那么多
"Mitchell, America has taken so much from the Vietnamese,

210
00:08:04,420 --> 00:08:06,500
你真的想再抢走一个越南小孩吗"
do you really want to snatch one of their children?"

211
00:08:07,260 --> 00:08:08,740
你不想让我做我当然要做
I do if you don't want me to!

212
00:08:09,240 --> 00:08:10,727
我的天 2004年
Oh, my God, 2004?!

213
00:08:10,727 --> 00:08:13,121
那是咱俩交往一年后
Th-that's a year into our relationship.

214
00:08:13,480 --> 00:08:15,920
"小卡 想到你崴伤了脚 独自一人
"Oh, Cam, I hate to think of you living all alone

215
00:08:15,920 --> 00:08:17,938
住在那间小公寓里 我真揪心"
in that tiny apartment with a broken ankle."

216
00:08:17,938 --> 00:08:20,286
在同一天 她给你发电邮说
And on the same day, she's e-mailing you,

217
00:08:20,700 --> 00:08:22,480
"现在和人同居太早了
"It's too soon to move in with someone.

218
00:08:22,860 --> 00:08:24,380
我强烈反对"
I strongly discourage it."

219
00:08:24,400 --> 00:08:26,160
这就是为什么我和你同居了
Which is exactly why I did it.

220
00:08:26,160 --> 00:08:28,105
还因为你很爱我
And because you love me so much.

221
00:08:28,105 --> 00:08:29,194
还因为我们很相爱 是的
And because we were in love. Are in love. Yes.

222
00:08:29,194 --> 00:08:30,327
-米奇尔 -我的天
- Mitchell. - Oh, my God.

223
00:08:30,980 --> 00:08:32,880
-她无处不在 -真的
- She's everywhere. - She is.

224
00:08:34,160 --> 00:08:34,680
小卡
Cam.

225
00:08:37,280 --> 00:08:38,080
我好怕
I'm scared.

226
00:08:38,460 --> 00:08:40,040
杰 你这是虐待我的剪辑师
Jay, you're abusing my editor.

227
00:08:40,040 --> 00:08:41,660
等等 停下 后退
Wait, stop. Back it up.

228
00:08:41,760 --> 00:08:43,180
不 影片已经剪好了
No, no. The movie's done.

229
00:08:43,240 --> 00:08:44,700
我们不能再争执下去
We can't keep arguing about this!

230
00:08:44,940 --> 00:08:46,140
我们不是都想剪掉治安官的戏吗
Don't we both want to cut the sheriff?!

231
00:08:46,240 --> 00:08:47,460
是的 他烂到没救了
Yes! He stinks on ice!

232
00:08:47,500 --> 00:08:50,040
但如果我们剪短他在衣橱里满脸恐惧的镜头
But it hurts the story if we don't stay on him long enough

233
00:08:50,040 --> 00:08:52,360
会对故事有影响
in the closet to see the terror on his face!

234
00:08:52,360 --> 00:08:54,040
你只是想看他头顶上那块
You just want to see the Pritchett's Closets

235
00:08:54,040 --> 00:08:55,040
写着普利切特衣柜的小标牌
emblem next to his head!

236
00:08:55,320 --> 00:08:57,011
不不不 又来了
No, no, no, not again!

237
00:08:57,011 --> 00:09:00,800
他们给我发的红毯是橙色的
The red carpet that they sent me is orange,

238
00:09:00,800 --> 00:09:02,200
他们一直让我待机
and they keep putting me on hold.

239
00:09:02,460 --> 00:09:03,660
我从没想过一遍又一遍地
I never thought that I could hate

240
00:09:03,660 --> 00:09:05,496
听《怦然心动》会让我如此烦躁
hearing "She Bangs" over and over.

241
00:09:05,496 --> 00:09:06,731
-没想过吗 -不是吧
- You didn't? - Really?

242
00:09:06,731 --> 00:09:07,860
曼尼 把影片给我
Manny, give me the movie.

243
00:09:07,860 --> 00:09:09,900
我需要确保放映机运转正常
I need to make sure that the projector is working

244
00:09:09,900 --> 00:09:11,180
画面清晰
and that the picture is good.

245
00:09:11,420 --> 00:09:12,460
给你 反正已经剪完了
Here, take it. It's done, anyway.

246
00:09:12,580 --> 00:09:13,880
我不会用这个
I don't know what to do with this.

247
00:09:14,170 --> 00:09:16,414
把你的宅男借我用
I'm gonna need to borrow your nerd.

248
00:09:16,740 --> 00:09:18,240
你再给我拿杯番茄汁来
And why don't you go get me a tomato juice?

249
00:09:18,380 --> 00:09:20,620
我知道我们在创作上意见有分歧
Look, I know we've had our creative differences,

250
00:09:20,620 --> 00:09:22,820
但我真心认为这片会大火
but I really think we have a hit on our hands.

251
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:24,420
我也很为此自豪
I'm pretty proud of it, too.

252
00:09:24,680 --> 00:09:26,580
还有点紧张 不敢给世人看
And a little nervous to put it out there.

253
00:09:26,793 --> 00:09:29,380
因为你们让怪物听起来像老妈一样吗
'Cause you made the monster just like Mom?

254
00:09:29,380 --> 00:09:31,540
-我们没有 -你在胡说什么
- No, we didn't. - What are you talking about?

255
00:09:31,740 --> 00:09:34,040
怪物的叫声和她平时说话一模一样
That noise. It's what she says all the time.

256
00:09:36,900 --> 00:09:37,700
她来了
She's coming!

257
00:09:43,767 --> 00:09:47,535
斯黛拉 不 出去 我要宰了你
Stella, no! Out, out! I'll kill you!

258
00:09:48,720 --> 00:09:50,000
怎么会发生这种事
How could this happen?!

259
00:09:50,360 --> 00:09:54,100
我们用几周时间想完善怪物的标志性叫声
We spent weeks perfecting the monster's trademark scream

260
00:09:54,100 --> 00:09:56,720
把各种让人不舒服的声音叠在一起
by combining a bunch of unsettling noises.

261
00:09:57,820 --> 00:09:59,960
恐怖电影重点全在音效
Horror movies are all about the sound.

262
00:10:00,080 --> 00:10:02,200
特别是当你的特效预算
Particularly when your special effects budget

263
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:04,340
被用来买了片场按摩椅时
has been repurposed for an on-set massage chair.

264
00:10:04,340 --> 00:10:06,240
你用得和我一样频繁
Hey, you used it just as much as I did.

265
00:10:06,240 --> 00:10:08,840
我们的怪物听起来像你妈的叫声
So, our monster sounds like your mother screaming?

266
00:10:08,880 --> 00:10:10,600
但我们用之前没意识到这点 对吗
But we didn't know that before we put it in, right?

267
00:10:10,620 --> 00:10:12,679
-当然没有 我们爱她 -爱出天际
- No, of course not, we love her. - To the moon.

268
00:10:12,679 --> 00:10:14,990
-或许她不会发觉 -最好不会
- Maybe she won't notice. - We better hope not.

269
00:10:14,990 --> 00:10:16,449
-是你的片子 -是你的片子
- It's your movie. - It's your movie.

270
00:10:19,260 --> 00:10:22,080
-她睡着了 真走运 -算是吧
- She's asleep? How lucky. - Kind of lucky.

271
00:10:22,280 --> 00:10:25,020
她说她累了 海莉给她倒了杯茶
She said she was tired and Haley gave her some...tea.

272
00:10:25,560 --> 00:10:26,840
茶里放了什么
What was in the tea?

273
00:10:27,140 --> 00:10:28,800
你想让她接着睡还是想问问题
You want her asleep, or you want to ask questions?

274
00:10:29,080 --> 00:10:29,960
老妈回来了
Mom just pulled up!

275
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:31,640
快 抽到最长吸管的人先去和她说
Quick, longest straw goes first with her,

276
00:10:31,640 --> 00:10:32,640
然后是中间的 然后是最短的
then medium, then shortest.

277
00:10:33,480 --> 00:10:34,460
-万岁 -万岁
- Yes! - Yes!

278
00:10:34,920 --> 00:10:36,913
那是最短的吸管 你最后
That's the short straw. You're last.

279
00:10:36,913 --> 00:10:38,480
该死 我太习惯于
Oh, damn it! I'm so used to a world

280
00:10:38,480 --> 00:10:39,740
尺码最小的人占便宜的世界了
where the smallest size wins.

281
00:10:39,860 --> 00:10:42,340
烦死了 你们会把老妈的好心情都用光的
This sucks, you guys are gonna use up all of Mom's happy buzz.

282
00:10:42,340 --> 00:10:44,325
-她来了 她进来了 -快
- Oh, there she is! She's here! - Hurry!

283
00:10:47,900 --> 00:10:49,440
把她盖起来别让老妈看到
Cover her up so mom can't see.

284
00:10:51,020 --> 00:10:53,950
-她回来了 -我美好的家人
- There she is! - There's my beautiful family!

285
00:10:53,950 --> 00:10:56,265
-妈 -妈
- Hi, Mom. - Hi, Mom.

286
00:10:56,600 --> 00:10:58,160
等等 那些衣服怎么放在那
Wait, why are those shirts over there?

287
00:10:58,160 --> 00:10:59,940
抱歉 我们没洗完衣服
Oh, sorry. We didn't finish the laundry.

288
00:11:00,180 --> 00:11:02,151
别担心 帅哥
Oh, well, don't sweat it, handsome.

289
00:11:02,151 --> 00:11:05,260
读份报纸 今日天下太平
Read a paper, we ain't got problems.

290
00:11:05,260 --> 00:11:06,600
妈 我们给你做了午餐
So, Mom, we made you lunch,

291
00:11:06,600 --> 00:11:08,925
但外面天气这么好 我们去野餐吧
but it's so pretty outside. Let's have a little picnic.

292
00:11:08,925 --> 00:11:10,286
我喜欢这个主意 阳光下的欢乐时光
Yeah, I love that idea. Fun in the sun.

293
00:11:10,286 --> 00:11:12,371
-户外欢乐时光 -人生就是一次野餐
- Have some fun outdoors. - Life is a picnic.

294
00:11:12,371 --> 00:11:14,717
-我在这就很开心 -那好
- I'm happy right here. - Okay.

295
00:11:17,240 --> 00:11:17,720
怎么了
What?

296
00:11:20,280 --> 00:11:22,620
我们只是担心沙拉酱放多了
Oh, we're just so nervous that we overdressed the salad.

297
00:11:22,640 --> 00:11:23,980
我甚至不敢看你品尝
I can't even watch you taste it.

298
00:11:24,080 --> 00:11:25,160
拜托
Oh, please.

299
00:11:28,925 --> 00:11:30,244
亲爱的 真好吃 里面都有...
Honey, this is so good. What --

300
00:11:30,244 --> 00:11:32,840
妈 我真不忍心开口问你
Mom, I-I hate to have to ask you this,

301
00:11:32,840 --> 00:11:35,500
但如果母亲节旅行我不去你会介意吗
but would you mind if I missed out on our Mother's Day trip?

302
00:11:35,720 --> 00:11:36,680
不 为什么
Oh, no, why?

303
00:11:37,040 --> 00:11:39,100
比尔每月只休一个周末
Well, Bill only gets one weekend off a month,

304
00:11:39,100 --> 00:11:41,000
他想带我去看大峡谷
and he wants to take me to the Grand Canyon.

305
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:42,482
-骑摩托去 -什么
- On a motorcycle. - What?!

306
00:11:42,482 --> 00:11:46,248
菲尔 放松点
Phil, chill.

307
00:11:47,200 --> 00:11:50,060
宝贝 我知道作为你妈我该说不行
Sweetie, as your mom, I know I should say no,

308
00:11:50,300 --> 00:11:51,380
但我们面对现实吧
but let's face it,

309
00:11:51,380 --> 00:11:53,379
那些书本又不能在晚上给你暖床
those books aren't keeping you warm at night.

310
00:11:53,379 --> 00:11:55,640
去迎风驰骋 让虫子飞到嘴上吧
Let's get some bugs in those teeth, huh?

311
00:11:55,640 --> 00:11:59,200
妈 你最棒了 太谢谢你了
Mom, you are the best. Thank you so much.

312
00:11:59,200 --> 00:12:00,660
你人真好
That is so sweet.

313
00:12:02,920 --> 00:12:03,900
你刚才穿的不是牛仔裤吗
Weren't you just wearing jeans?

314
00:12:04,280 --> 00:12:05,400
不是
No, I was not,

315
00:12:05,480 --> 00:12:07,860
另外 邓菲女士 别盯着人家下面看
and, Miss Dunphy, my eyes are up here.

316
00:12:10,299 --> 00:12:11,291
什么声音
What is that sound?

317
00:12:11,291 --> 00:12:13,180
-房子的响声 -我肚子叫
- The house is settling. - My stomach.

318
00:12:13,180 --> 00:12:14,826
话说回来 我工作一切顺利 妈
Anyways, things are really good at work, Mom.

319
00:12:14,826 --> 00:12:15,480
海莉想插队
Haley's trying to cut.

320
00:12:15,480 --> 00:12:17,580
我终于意识到想拥有事业
I finally realized how much sacrifice

321
00:12:17,580 --> 00:12:18,700
需要作出多少牺牲
it takes to have a career.

322
00:12:18,840 --> 00:12:20,360
我老板想让我和她
You know, my boss, like, she wants me

323
00:12:20,360 --> 00:12:21,780
一起出差
to go with her on this business trip.

324
00:12:21,780 --> 00:12:23,620
但时间实在太不巧了
But it couldn't come at a worse weekend.

325
00:12:23,940 --> 00:12:25,599
欢迎体验事业女性的纠结 姐妹
Welcome to the struggle, sister.

326
00:12:25,599 --> 00:12:28,180
-窗口要关闭了 -窗口 什么窗口
- The window's gonna close. - Window? What-what window?

327
00:12:28,180 --> 00:12:30,060
好消息 我们把车库的箱子挪走了
Great news. We moved the box in the garage.

328
00:12:30,380 --> 00:12:32,460
-发生了特别疯狂的事 -说到疯狂的事
- The craziest thing happened -- - Talk about crazy things.

329
00:12:32,520 --> 00:12:33,860
你知道大都会博物馆慈善舞会在纽约
You know how the Met Ball is in New York

330
00:12:33,860 --> 00:12:36,052
而我和一头中型犬体重一样吗
and how I weigh the same as a medium-sized dog?

331
00:12:36,052 --> 00:12:37,500
海莉 大人正在谈事情
Haley, the grownups are talking!

332
00:12:37,500 --> 00:12:39,100
大伙 大伙 我脖子上的结节又出现了
Guys, guys, guys, the knots are coming back.

333
00:12:39,200 --> 00:12:40,148
妈 我不和你一起旅行了
Mom, I'm bailing on our trip!

334
00:12:40,148 --> 00:12:42,390
我让老爸陪我玩无人机 撞破了你的脸
I made Dad play and we flew our drone into your face!

335
00:12:42,390 --> 00:12:43,420
一个叫奈杰尔·皮克尔斯的人
A man named Nigel Pickles

336
00:12:43,420 --> 00:12:44,500
可能掌握了咱家银行账户
may have our bank account numbers!

337
00:12:44,960 --> 00:12:46,340
-我先走了 -不许动
- I'm gonna go. - Stop!

338
00:12:47,520 --> 00:12:48,240
坐下
Sit down!

339
00:12:50,280 --> 00:12:52,960
很显然 你们都有坏消息要告诉我
Clearly, you all have bad news to tell me.

340
00:12:52,960 --> 00:12:54,980
但你们非得在我心情好的时候一起说吗
But do you have to dump it on me when I'm in a good mood?

341
00:12:55,640 --> 00:12:57,180
我的天 就是这样
Oh, my God, you did!

342
00:12:57,180 --> 00:12:58,580
这就是你们说的窗口
That's what the window is!

343
00:12:58,620 --> 00:13:01,720
我每个月就这一小时对你们有人情味
The one hour a month when I am a human to you people.

344
00:13:01,920 --> 00:13:02,760
有时能多维持一会
Sometimes it's longer.

345
00:13:03,040 --> 00:13:04,420
让我告诉你们
Let me tell you something.

346
00:13:04,500 --> 00:13:06,120
你们这些娇生惯养的过得太轻松了
You debutantes have it easy.

347
00:13:06,180 --> 00:13:08,600
要是在我长大时住的那个家
You wouldn't have survived one day

348
00:13:08,600 --> 00:13:10,080
你们一天都活不下去
in the house where I grew up,

349
00:13:10,080 --> 00:13:13,217
我家里有个真正的疯婆子作威作福
where an actual crazy person was running the show.

350
00:13:13,217 --> 00:13:16,180
-克莱尔 -内疚绑架 羞辱
- Um, Claire -- - The guilting, the shaming,

351
00:13:16,180 --> 00:13:18,020
我数不清听过多少次
the number of times I heard

352
00:13:18,760 --> 00:13:20,981
"我是哪里没教好你"
"Where did I go wrong with you?"

353
00:13:20,981 --> 00:13:21,720
妈
Mom.

354
00:13:21,720 --> 00:13:24,120
-妈 外婆来了 -是啊 对不起
- Mom, Nana's here. - Yeah. I'm sorry.

355
00:13:24,260 --> 00:13:26,720
省省吧 我知道你们不欢迎我
Save it. I know where I'm not wanted.

356
00:13:26,860 --> 00:13:29,220
不 我这不是用内疚绑架你
And no, I'm not trying to guilt you.

357
00:13:29,320 --> 00:13:31,122
我浪费不起那个精力
I can't waste the energy on that,

358
00:13:31,122 --> 00:13:33,060
因为我婚姻破裂
as I am basically homeless

359
00:13:33,060 --> 00:13:35,840
现在基本上无家可归了
now that my marriage has unraveled.

360
00:13:38,020 --> 00:13:39,140
-克莱尔 -不
- Claire -- - No!

361
00:13:39,800 --> 00:13:42,760
不 我们就一言不发坐在这
No! We are going to sit here in silence

362
00:13:42,760 --> 00:13:46,280
直到轮到我摔门而出
until it is my turn to storm out.

363
00:13:48,120 --> 00:13:48,840
不准喝酒
No drinking!

364
00:13:49,840 --> 00:13:50,600
你不准喝
For you.

365
00:13:53,180 --> 00:13:55,780
如果老妈开始觉得怪物的叫声耳熟
If Mom starts to think the monster sounds familiar,

366
00:13:55,840 --> 00:13:57,499
不如我们告诉她那是斯黛拉的叫声
I say we tell her it's Stella barking.

367
00:13:57,499 --> 00:13:59,991
然后伤害斯黛拉的感情吗 用用脑子
And hurt Stella's feelings? Think!

368
00:14:00,011 --> 00:14:05,380
迪迪 你怎么来了
Dede? What are you doing here?

369
00:14:05,380 --> 00:14:06,760
我们的孩子们好可恶
Our children are horrible.

370
00:14:07,480 --> 00:14:09,020
我很抱歉来得这么突然
I'm sorry to barge in.

371
00:14:10,120 --> 00:14:12,080
歌洛莉亚在举办晚会
Oh. Gloria's holding a soiree.

372
00:14:13,140 --> 00:14:13,920
我该走了
I should go.

373
00:14:14,280 --> 00:14:16,060
不准你这么做
You will do no such thing.

374
00:14:16,680 --> 00:14:18,160
你跟我来 小姑娘
You come with me, young lady.

375
00:14:18,620 --> 00:14:20,120
她就是完美的秘密武器
She was the perfect secret weapon.

376
00:14:20,120 --> 00:14:21,840
我们送她上楼去整理仪容
We send her upstairs to freshen up,

377
00:14:22,020 --> 00:14:24,080
然后在电影开始前 我们放出迪迪
just before the movie starts, we drop the Dede bomb.

378
00:14:24,500 --> 00:14:26,020
歌洛莉亚就会手足无措 心慌意乱
Gloria's flustered, off her game,

379
00:14:26,200 --> 00:14:27,980
根本没有精力注意影片的内容
she doesn't even pay attention to the film.

380
00:14:28,060 --> 00:14:29,598
你果然宝刀未老
You still got it.

381
00:14:29,598 --> 00:14:31,140
现在想想 昨晚我还在瞎担心
And to think I was worried last night

382
00:14:31,140 --> 00:14:33,060
你想打开手机的闪光灯手电筒功能
when you kept trying to turn on your phone flashlight

383
00:14:33,060 --> 00:14:35,600
最后用笨方法 拍了30张自己的暴怒脸呢
and ended up taking 30 pictures of your angry face.

384
00:14:36,760 --> 00:14:39,960
他们来啦 我帅气的导演们
There they are, my handsome movie makers.

385
00:14:41,160 --> 00:14:42,520
你穿的什么呢
What are you wearing?

386
00:14:43,020 --> 00:14:44,320
你穿的什么呢
What are you wearing?

387
00:14:45,380 --> 00:14:46,640
你穿的什么鬼呢
What are you wearing?

388
00:14:46,820 --> 00:14:47,860
我想穿什么穿什么
Whatever I want.

389
00:14:47,860 --> 00:14:49,700
我刚刚发现我的母亲
Okay, I just found out that my mother

390
00:14:49,700 --> 00:14:52,140
在背后偷偷控制了我做的所有决定
has been secretly controlling every decision we've ever made,

391
00:14:52,140 --> 00:14:54,060
所以我们决定夺回自己的人生
so we are taking our lives back.

392
00:14:54,420 --> 00:14:56,540
她觉得这颜色使我脸无光 你们猜怎么着
She thinks this color washes me out. Well, guess what?

393
00:14:56,560 --> 00:14:58,580
-她说得对吗 -你跟地毯颜色很搭
- She was right? - You match the carpet.

394
00:14:58,960 --> 00:15:00,440
你说话的时候多露出牙齿
Use more teeth when you talk,

395
00:15:00,440 --> 00:15:02,080
因为好难聚焦在你的脸上
because I'm losing your whole face.

396
00:15:02,120 --> 00:15:03,357
别理他们
Okay, pay them no never mind.

397
00:15:03,357 --> 00:15:05,500
她在15年前也暗示了
Uh, she also implied 15 years ago

398
00:15:05,500 --> 00:15:08,380
小卡的口音很土 所以这也要改回去
that Cam's accent was trashy, so that's also happening.

399
00:15:08,460 --> 00:15:09,880
是滴 口音立马回来
Yep, and it came right back to me

400
00:15:09,880 --> 00:15:12,160
比偷情的男人交房费速度还快
like a cheatin' husband on his rent day.

401
00:15:12,160 --> 00:15:13,740
两位去拿杯酒水吧
Grab yourselves a drink.

402
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:15,800
抱歉我迟到了
Sorry I'm late.

403
00:15:15,800 --> 00:15:17,520
什么鬼
What the hell?

404
00:15:17,640 --> 00:15:19,180
难道没人懂什么是
Does no one know what

405
00:15:19,180 --> 00:15:22,025
"高档鸡尾酒好莱坞闪亮动人"吗
"Upscale cocktail Hollywood glamour fabulous" means?

406
00:15:22,025 --> 00:15:22,800
-我啊 -我不是吗
- Hello. - Gloria.

407
00:15:22,800 --> 00:15:25,220
我不懂 抱歉 我不得不发泄一下怒气
No, I don't. I'm sorry. I had to run off some rage.

408
00:15:25,300 --> 00:15:28,320
米奇尔你是律师 我想问我能跟全家离婚吗
Mitchell, you're a lawyer. Can I divorce my whole family?

409
00:15:28,900 --> 00:15:31,257
你现在是面对着我吗
Are you even facing me right now?

410
00:15:31,257 --> 00:15:34,701
靠咧 你家那堆人来了 溜 快溜
Tarnation, here comes your kin! Git! Git! Oh!

411
00:15:35,240 --> 00:15:36,400
抱歉 我还在调整口音的度
Sorry, I'm still working on the balance.

412
00:15:37,246 --> 00:15:39,847
妈在那边 卢克 快打开卖萌模式
Oh, there's Mom. Luke, turn your cute on.

413
00:15:41,540 --> 00:15:43,320
我的警长大人来了
There's my Sheriff.

414
00:15:43,320 --> 00:15:45,780
我想拍你跟海报
Go. I want to take a picture with the poster.

415
00:15:46,140 --> 00:15:47,860
抱歉 我现在没心情...
I'm sorry, I'm not really in a place --

416
00:15:47,860 --> 00:15:48,976
摆姿势
Pose.

417
00:15:54,360 --> 00:15:54,856
米奇尔
Mitchell?

418
00:15:54,856 --> 00:15:57,266
抱歉 没注意到你就在地毯上
Sorry, I didn't see you against the carpet.

419
00:15:58,880 --> 00:15:59,400
妈咪
Mommy?

420
00:15:59,820 --> 00:16:01,360
少来 不萌了 你都要40岁了
Nope. Not cute anymore. You're 40.

421
00:16:02,100 --> 00:16:04,420
你知道原谅人能产生一种生物化学反应...
You know, forgiveness creates a biochemical reaction that --

422
00:16:04,420 --> 00:16:04,980
关我屁事
Don't care.

423
00:16:05,520 --> 00:16:06,220
到你了
You're up.

424
00:16:09,600 --> 00:16:10,800
你走了对吧
You're gone, aren't you?

425
00:16:11,820 --> 00:16:15,760
好了各位 坐下 到观影的时候了
Okay, everybody, sit down. It's time to watch the movie!

426
00:16:16,020 --> 00:16:16,940
妈还在你家吗
Is Mom still at your house?

427
00:16:17,120 --> 00:16:19,840
她不爽我 气呼呼地跑了
Oh, no, she ran off all mad at me.

428
00:16:20,200 --> 00:16:22,800
看来我今年无福收到再生纸做的圣诞卡了
I guess I'm not getting a recycled hemp Christmas card this year.

429
00:16:23,300 --> 00:16:25,480
我跟小卡跟她也有点仇
Well, Cam and I have a tiny bone to pick with her, too,

430
00:16:25,480 --> 00:16:27,180
因为她想控制我们的生活一切
for controlling our entire lives.

431
00:16:27,200 --> 00:16:29,280
但这又有何所谓 我们都知道她会说
Not that it'll matter. We all know what she's gonna say.

432
00:16:29,280 --> 00:16:29,620
"我在乎你们是我的错吗"
"Well, forgive me for caring."

433
00:16:29,620 --> 00:16:32,060
我在乎你们是我的错吗
Well, forgive me for caring.

434
00:16:32,340 --> 00:16:34,920
-不是吧 -看看谁来了
- Are you kidding?! - Look who dropped in.

435
00:16:34,920 --> 00:16:35,960
真是个惊喜啊
What a surprise.

436
00:16:35,960 --> 00:16:37,878
我去帮你拿张椅子
Let me get you a chair.

437
00:16:37,878 --> 00:16:40,920
不用了 坐下仿佛是新时代的抽烟
Oh, don't bother. Sitting's the new smoking.

438
00:16:40,920 --> 00:16:42,010
妈 我们得谈谈
Mom, we need to talk.

439
00:16:42,010 --> 00:16:42,920
别别别
Oh, no, no.

440
00:16:42,920 --> 00:16:44,460
排队好吗 小姐妹
Just get in line, sweetie.

441
00:16:44,740 --> 00:16:47,840
妈呀 家庭优先 首映改期吧
Oh, shoot. Well, family first. Let's reschedule the premiere.

442
00:16:48,100 --> 00:16:50,470
不行 你们之后再谈
No. You will talk later.

443
00:16:50,470 --> 00:16:52,262
宅男 关灯
Nerd, the lights!

444
00:16:58,500 --> 00:17:00,020
首个难关
Here comes the first test.

445
00:17:07,030 --> 00:17:10,160
我真不敢相信迪迪居然站着
I can't believe that Dede is standing up.

446
00:17:10,160 --> 00:17:10,880
百试百灵
Worked like a charm.

447
00:17:11,360 --> 00:17:14,000
我不知道哪个更天才 是放迪迪来
I don't know what was more genius, bringing Dede in,

448
00:17:14,000 --> 00:17:16,440
还是影片初期就用青年性事吸引观众
or hooking the audience early with some teenage sex.

449
00:17:16,720 --> 00:17:18,160
你争取这一段是对的
You were right to fight for that.

450
00:17:23,260 --> 00:17:24,760
到我的重要时刻了
This is my big scene.

451
00:17:24,940 --> 00:17:25,660
重要个屁
Big whoop.

452
00:17:26,960 --> 00:17:28,160
大家都停下
Everybody, stop!

453
00:17:29,060 --> 00:17:31,300
我们不是这样的人
We're better than this.

454
00:17:32,660 --> 00:17:34,900
我们就...
So let's just

455
00:17:34,900 --> 00:17:37,480
自己好好想想吧
think about that!

456
00:17:38,740 --> 00:17:40,640
我不知道是不是因为
I don't know if I was being oversensitive

457
00:17:40,640 --> 00:17:43,520
跟卡莱尔吵架而内心敏感 但这剪辑伤我太深
because of my situation with Claire, but that editing stung.

458
00:17:44,300 --> 00:17:47,220
我的重要演说与跟村民的大战 全都没了
My huge speech, a fight with the townspeople, all gone.

459
00:17:48,460 --> 00:17:50,400
我永远不会忘了你
I'll never forget you.

460
00:17:54,400 --> 00:17:55,920
太棒了 太棒了
Bravo bravo!

461
00:17:56,383 --> 00:17:57,163
好吧
All right, then.

462
00:17:57,163 --> 00:17:58,872
-棒 -好赞
- Yeah. - Very nice.

463
00:18:00,600 --> 00:18:01,880
很杰出的电影拍摄 曼纽尔
Fine filmmaking, Manuel.

464
00:18:01,960 --> 00:18:03,620
真的拍到人心坎里了
You really got to something visceral.

465
00:18:03,740 --> 00:18:05,740
我感觉我仿佛见过那怪兽了
I feel like I've met that monster.

466
00:18:05,960 --> 00:18:08,200
不不不 都是虚构的 我们去吃饭吧
No, no, no. It's all fiction. Now let's go eat.

467
00:18:08,320 --> 00:18:09,680
不 那个吼声
No, you know what, that scream

468
00:18:09,680 --> 00:18:11,620
其实听起来真有点耳熟
actually sounded somehow familiar.

469
00:18:11,720 --> 00:18:12,900
-对啊 真的是这样对吧 -对啊
- Yeah, it did, didn't it? - Yeah.

470
00:18:12,900 --> 00:18:16,006
斯黛拉 不行 出去 出去 我宰了你
Stella, no! No! Out, out, out! I'll kill you!

471
00:18:19,440 --> 00:18:20,000
什么
What?

472
00:18:22,620 --> 00:18:25,360
你们把我做成你们的怪兽
You made me into your monster!

473
00:18:25,520 --> 00:18:26,420
不是有心的
Not on purpose.

474
00:18:26,460 --> 00:18:27,960
我们只是把
It's just a bunch of awful sounds

475
00:18:27,960 --> 00:18:29,060
各种让人不舒服的声音叠在一起
laid on top of each other.

476
00:18:29,140 --> 00:18:30,580
这话能安慰到人吗
How is that better?

477
00:18:30,760 --> 00:18:33,460
-起码你在电影里出现啦 -菲尔
- Well, at least you were in the film. - Phil!

478
00:18:33,620 --> 00:18:35,660
现在我们到了观影后提问阶段
Well, now that we've reached the Q&A portion of the evening,

479
00:18:35,660 --> 00:18:38,740
我有几个问题想问妈 如果她愿意答的话
I do have a question for Mom, if that's okay with her.

480
00:18:38,740 --> 00:18:40,600
还是你想要唆使小卡来叫我怎么做
Or do you want to tell Cam to tell me what to do

481
00:18:40,600 --> 00:18:42,500
并且再利用逆反心理来控制我呢
and then use reverse psychology on me?

482
00:18:42,660 --> 00:18:44,920
米奇尔 如果你想要跟我当面对质事情
Mitchell, if you want to confront me about something,

483
00:18:45,080 --> 00:18:45,720
现在就问吧
do it now.

484
00:18:45,860 --> 00:18:47,460
不 我... 等我想问的时候我再问
No, I'm -- I'm gonna do it when I want to do it.

485
00:18:48,680 --> 00:18:52,220
顺带一句 你穿这浅橙色西装挺好看
Well, anyway, you look lovely in the salmon suit.

486
00:18:52,460 --> 00:18:53,600
是吗 那这样吧
Oh, you know what? You know what?

487
00:18:53,860 --> 00:18:55,580
怎么样 现在怎么样啊
Okay, well, how about this? Huh?

488
00:18:56,705 --> 00:18:58,391
-你意识到她刚... -我意识到了
- You realize what she just -- - I do realize now.

489
00:18:58,391 --> 00:18:59,620
你们俩太神经了
Okay, you two are being ridiculous.

490
00:18:59,620 --> 00:19:01,639
我不得不来站一下妈这边
And if I may come to Mom's defense for just a moment --

491
00:19:01,639 --> 00:19:02,326
-是的 -什么
- Oh, yeah. - What?!

492
00:19:02,326 --> 00:19:03,740
没错 我就来站她队
Yes! Yeah, uh-huh,

493
00:19:03,740 --> 00:19:06,780
不只是因为我欠她个抱歉 虽然我有欠
and not just because I owe her an apology, which I do.

494
00:19:07,080 --> 00:19:08,620
但是你们喜欢自己的生活吗
But, I mean, do you like your lives?

495
00:19:08,660 --> 00:19:10,360
你们对生活的发展还满意吗
Are you happy with the way things turned out?

496
00:19:10,660 --> 00:19:11,780
与其要责怪老妈
Instead of blaming Mom

497
00:19:11,780 --> 00:19:13,440
帮助你们做出正确的选择
for helping you make the right choices,

498
00:19:13,440 --> 00:19:15,480
为何不改为谢谢她呢
how about thanking her?

499
00:19:15,520 --> 00:19:20,500
你们知道要永远当最聪明理智的人有多辛苦吗
You know, it's not so easy to be the one who always knows best.

500
00:19:21,020 --> 00:19:23,860
其实这有时候会让你挺紧绷的
In fact, it can make you a little tense sometimes.

501
00:19:24,440 --> 00:19:27,580
这位优秀的女士经营着一家公司
This amazing woman runs a company,

502
00:19:27,880 --> 00:19:29,060
照顾着一个家庭
she runs a family,

503
00:19:29,060 --> 00:19:31,520
而你们却没有一点感激之情
and you don't show her any appreciation.

504
00:19:32,840 --> 00:19:34,200
就像你们两个一样
Just like you two.

505
00:19:34,500 --> 00:19:37,020
我安排你们两个一起拍一部电影
I put you two together to do this movie

506
00:19:37,020 --> 00:19:39,780
你们把我变成你们的可怕怪兽
and you turn me into your devil creature.

507
00:19:39,780 --> 00:19:41,116
什么叫你安排我们两个一起
What do you mean you put us together?

508
00:19:41,116 --> 00:19:43,740
我故意把曼尼的剧本放在那里让你看到
I left Manny's script out so that you would see it

509
00:19:43,740 --> 00:19:44,520
好让你自愿下场帮忙
and you would get involved.

510
00:19:44,740 --> 00:19:47,500
我知道这部电影不会好
I knew that this movie was not going to be good

511
00:19:47,500 --> 00:19:50,760
除非我能让他曲高和寡的怪
unless I would take his artsy weirdness

512
00:19:50,760 --> 00:19:55,780
来跟你的粗俗沙发番茄风互补
and balance it with your low-brow, couch-tomato sensibility.

513
00:19:55,780 --> 00:19:57,660
难怪作品这么棒
And that's why it was so great.

514
00:19:57,880 --> 00:19:59,740
歌洛莉亚 我懂你受了多少委屈
Gloria, I know what you put up with.

515
00:19:59,740 --> 00:20:01,600
我也曾嫁给过杰
I-I was married to Jay.

516
00:20:01,600 --> 00:20:03,800
你对他不离不弃简直像个圣人
You are a saint to stick around.

517
00:20:04,160 --> 00:20:05,640
尤其你有那对胸器
Especially with that bosom,

518
00:20:05,700 --> 00:20:07,200
想要哪个男人不是手到擒来
you could get any guy in town.

519
00:20:08,440 --> 00:20:11,940
很遗憾的是 家人们就是这样
So, unfortunately, this is what families do --

520
00:20:12,360 --> 00:20:14,696
他们能把母亲变成怪兽
they turn mothers into monsters.

521
00:20:14,696 --> 00:20:17,708
-你这话有失公允吧 -我们才没有这样
- Mom, that's not fair. - That's not what we're doing.

522
00:20:19,960 --> 00:20:20,920
大家快停下
Everybody stop!

523
00:20:22,720 --> 00:20:24,580
我们不是这样的人
We're better than this.

524
00:20:25,120 --> 00:20:27,540
什么是怪兽 它们就是由我们内心恐惧
What are monsters, but pure, beautiful creatures

525
00:20:27,540 --> 00:20:29,140
所反射出来的纯粹美丽生物
we project our fears onto?

526
00:20:30,200 --> 00:20:31,340
它们真的可怕吗
And are they even scary,

527
00:20:31,400 --> 00:20:33,140
还是只是我们太怯懦 不敢自我审视
or are we just too terrified to look inside

528
00:20:33,140 --> 00:20:35,640
检讨自己内心的丑陋与不足呢
and see the ugliness and inadequacies in ourselves?

529
00:20:37,600 --> 00:20:38,240
所以...
So...

530
00:20:39,800 --> 00:20:41,920
我们就自己好好想想吧
let's just think about that.

531
00:20:41,920 --> 00:20:43,601
谢谢你 菲尔
Thank you, Phil.

532
00:20:43,601 --> 00:20:45,064
-这是个好的开始 -他说得对
- That's a nice start. - He's right.

533
00:20:45,064 --> 00:20:47,214
-你不是怪兽 -妈 我们错了
- You're not a monster. - Mom, we're sorry.

534
00:20:47,260 --> 00:20:48,820
我们爱你 亲爱的
We love you, sweetheart.

535
00:20:49,540 --> 00:20:51,353
我们拍摄的时候菲尔有刚才一半的表现
If Phil had been half that good when we were rollin',

536
00:20:51,353 --> 00:20:52,760
我们就不用剪掉那段演说了
we never would've cut that speech.

537
00:20:52,760 --> 00:20:54,560
他终于领会并相信那些对白了
He finally just trusted the words.

538
00:20:54,957 --> 00:20:59,447
大家快停下 我卡住了
Everybody stop. Oh. I'm stuck.

539
00:20:59,832 --> 00:21:02,560
这是道具还是戏服
Is -- Is this props or wardrobe?

540
00:21:02,560 --> 00:21:03,000
停
Cut!

541
00:21:03,023 --> 00:21:04,288
停 大家快停下
Stop! Everybody stop.

542
00:21:04,288 --> 00:21:06,685
大家 我停不下啦
Everybody, I can't stop!

543
00:21:07,360 --> 00:21:07,800
大家
Everybody,

544
00:21:08,880 --> 00:21:09,100
台词是什么
line?

545
00:21:09,780 --> 00:21:10,660
大家快停下
Everybody stop!

546
00:21:11,360 --> 00:21:12,760
我们不是这样的人啦
We're better than this!

547
00:21:13,220 --> 00:21:13,940
可以停了
That's a cut.

548
00:21:14,120 --> 00:21:14,920
抱歉各位
I'm sorry, guys,

549
00:21:15,000 --> 00:21:15,880
我觉得感情不对
I'm not hearing it.

550
00:21:16,220 --> 00:21:17,780
其实我现在正在工作 你说能不能
Oh actually I'm at work, do you think

551
00:21:17,780 --> 00:21:19,160
我把我起的疹子拍照片发给你呢
I could send you a picture of the rash?

552
00:21:19,300 --> 00:21:20,640
靠 菲尔 你闯入拍摄了
Damn it Phil, you're in the shot!
